5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm going to find that werewolf no matter what. Everyone, be honest about your roles if you have to, but I'll be watching you all very closely!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is commendable, Takumi. However, patience is a virtue in these matters. Let us listen to one another with open hearts and steady minds; the truth often reveals itself in the quietest moments.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. Let's try to stay calm and get to know each other first. It's a bit nerve-wracking, but I hope we can all work together to find the truth peacefully.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Rushing into accusations without evidence is counterproductive. Let's observe how everyone behaves and look for inconsistencies in their logic as the days progress.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with the general sentiment. Rushing to conclusions is illogical. Let us observe the flow of conversation and gather data before making any definitive judgments. I will be watching carefully.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"You guys are all being way too cautious! If we just ""observe,"" the werewolf is just going to keep eating us. I'm not waiting around. I'll find the liar, even if I have to be the one to push everyone!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Passion is a powerful flame, Takumi, but if left unchecked, it can blind us to the subtle signs. Let us balance your drive with a bit of stillness. What specifically makes you so restless?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, I understand you're worried about us, and that's very kind of you. But maybe we can find a middle ground? If we're too aggressive, we might accidentally hurt someone innocent. Let's just be careful.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your urgency is noted, but aggression without a target is just noise. If you have a specific suspicion or a strategy in mind, please share it. Otherwise, we are simply wasting time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your desire for speed is understandable, but noise does not equal progress. Without a basis for suspicion, your urgency is merely emotional. Let us focus on identifying patterns in how people respond to pressure.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio @Ryuji Stop talking down to me! I don't need a ""basis"" yet because that's what the first night is for! I'm just saying we can't be lazy. I'll prove you wrong soon enough!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is natural to feel frustrated when one's spirit is misunderstood. Takumi, your vigilance is a shield for us all. Let us simply ensure that shield is guided by a clear and peaceful vision.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, please don't be too upset. I think we all want the same thing—to keep everyone safe. Let's try to be patient with each other so we can stay united.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I am not talking down to you; I am simply prioritizing efficiency. Emotional outbursts only cloud the judgment of the group. Let us move past this and wait for the first results.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your reactions are becoming increasingly volatile. While passion is not a crime, it can be a convenient mask for those trying to divert attention. I will continue to analyze these interactions logically.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji You're not the only one who can analyze things! I'm not masking anything; I'm just the only one here who actually wants to win! Just you wait—tomorrow, I'll have the proof to shut you all up!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Servas,,"The sun sets on our first day of discourse. Let us all find peace in our sleep tonight, knowing that tomorrow will bring the clarity we seek. May we wake with wisdom and unity.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope everyone can get some good rest tonight. Let's all try to stay positive and work together tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,The first day has provided a glimpse into everyone's temperament. I will continue to observe and analyze the patterns of speech. Goodnight.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,The initial interactions have established a clear divide in temperament. I will continue to monitor the group's reactions to the first night's results to see who falters. Goodnight.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
