68,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The morning air is heavy with loss. Toshio has departed from us, and Takumi has fallen to a cruel attack. In the face of such tragedy, we must remain steadfast and lean on one another for strength.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh no, this is terrible... I can't believe both Toshio and Takumi are gone. I'm so shocked. @Servas, you're right, we have to stay strong. We only have three of us left now. What should we do?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The situation has shifted drastically. Takumi's death suggests he was likely the Seer, as the Werewolf would prioritize removing the most dangerous threat. This leaves us with a critical lack of information. @Servas, @Midori, what are your thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a sorrowful turn of events. Ryuji, your logic is sound; the Werewolf often strikes the one who sees too much. We must now trust our intuition and the echoes of the conversations we have shared. Midori, dear, what do you feel?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I feel so lost... it's just the three of us now. @Ryuji, if Takumi really was the Seer, then the werewolf is still among us, pretending to be our friend. It's so scary to think about. I trust you both, but I'm frightened.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, fear is a natural response, but it is an obstacle to reason. We must analyze the remaining possibilities. Since Takumi is gone, we have no more divination. We must determine who among us is the Werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Servas,,"In these moments of shadow, we must not let fear guide our hands. Ryuji, your mind is a sharp tool, but let us also listen to the heart. Midori, your honesty is a light. Who among us feels the most dissonance?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, you're always so kind, but I'm really struggling. @Ryuji, you're so logical, but that almost makes it scarier because a werewolf could just be acting that way. I don't want to suspect anyone, but we have to...","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, your point is valid. Logic can be a mask, just as kindness can be. However, we must avoid paralysis. @Servas, you have remained consistently ambiguous. In this reduced group, that ambiguity is now a liability.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Ambiguity is often where the truth hides, Ryuji, but I have nothing to conceal. If my stillness troubles you, perhaps it is because you seek a storm where there is only a calm sea. What does your logic suggest?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, please don't be too hard on Servas. He's been so supportive of all of us. But... if we have to decide, I'm just so scared of making a mistake. What do you think is the most logical choice, @Ryuji?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, the most logical choice is to eliminate the player whose behavior provides the least amount of verifiable data. @Servas, your consistent ambiguity makes you the most probable candidate for the Werewolf. I propose we vote for you.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
